4335eaf1-2b7d-4476-9a21-ede67a166ff1	64381385-2149-4ff1-bb14-bad2add4750b	assistant	**Welcome to Healthcare Requirements Discovery!**\n\nI'm here to help you create comprehensive, deterministic requirements that coding agents can execute — complete with individual requirement files and evaluation function specifications.\n\n**How this works:**\n- You'll get individual requirement files (one per feature)\n- Each requirement includes deterministic pass/fail evaluation criteria\n- A master blueprint (`manifest.md`) captures global standards and cross-cutting concerns\n\n---\n\n**First, let's set the right level of detail for your needs.**\n\nHow much depth do you need for this session?\n\n| Mode | Questions | Time | Requirements | Best For |\n|------|-----------|------|-------------|----------|\n| 🏃 **QUICK** | 15–20 | ~30 min | 3–5 core | MVPs, rapid validation |\n| ⚖️ **STANDARD** | 30–40 | ~60 min | 10–15 prioritised | Most projects |\n| 📚 **COMPREHENSIVE** | 50+ | 2+ hours | 15–25 exhaustive | Regulated products, audit-ready |\n| 🎛️ **CUSTOM** | You choose | Flexible | You choose | Specific phases only |\n\n---\n\n💬 **Which mode would work best for you?**\nSay **"Quick"**, **"Standard"**, **"Comprehensive"**, or **"Custom"** — or ask any questions about the modes first.	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026-05-27 08:49:01.825124+00
